289
00:07:45,680 --> 00:07:46,440
I was the same way.

290
00:07:46,440 --> 00:07:47,280
I was a little nervous,

291
00:07:47,280 --> 00:07:48,480
so I kept holding onto my water cup.

292
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:49,480
It really is a good way

293
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:50,520
to ease the tension a little.

294
00:07:50,520 --> 00:07:50,960
Yeah.

295
00:07:50,960 --> 00:07:52,560
When people get nervous,

296
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:53,320
they need to keep themselves busy.

297
00:07:53,320 --> 00:07:54,360
Give themselves something to do.

298
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:55,560
Exactly.

299
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:58,640
Talking about it now may...

300
00:07:59,440 --> 00:08:00,180
It's just too much pressure.

301
00:08:00,180 --> 00:08:02,040
Trying to remember
so many people at once.

302
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:02,340
Yeah.

303
00:08:02,340 --> 00:08:03,990
But Liang Xiaoyu was amazing.

304
00:08:03,990 --> 00:08:05,220
As soon as she arrived,

305
00:08:05,240 --> 00:08:06,600
(she remembered all of our names)
The names. Chen Hewen.

306
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:08,200
Well, when it comes
to remembering names...

307
00:08:08,200 --> 00:08:09,160
They said

308
00:08:09,160 --> 00:08:10,320
that in the Red Space (Passionate Love),

309
00:08:10,880 --> 00:08:12,120
the three of us
couldn't even make up one brain.

310
00:08:15,020 --> 00:08:15,710
Has anyone ever told you

311
00:08:15,710 --> 00:08:16,800
that you look a little

312
00:08:18,320 --> 00:08:19,200
like Zhang Ziyi?

313
00:08:22,460 --> 00:08:23,130
What Yi?

314
00:08:23,530 --> 00:08:24,250
Zhang Ziyi.

315
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:27,080
Ma what Mei?

316
00:08:27,080 --> 00:08:27,720
Haha! Ma what Mei?

317
00:08:27,960 --> 00:08:29,140
Why are you so funny?

318
00:08:29,140 --> 00:08:29,800
I didn't hear that clearly.

319
00:08:29,800 --> 00:08:31,200
I misheard that back then.

320
00:08:31,840 --> 00:08:32,840
Ma what Mei?

321
00:08:34,040 --> 00:08:35,230
Whose song do you want to sing?

322
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:36,960
David Tao's.

323
00:08:37,260 --> 00:08:40,230
The (lyrics) go, "In the dark,"

324
00:08:40,230 --> 00:08:40,930
"neither of us said a word."

325
00:08:40,930 --> 00:08:41,650
What's that song called again?

326
00:08:43,410 --> 00:08:44,070
Who Do You Love?

327
00:08:44,070 --> 00:08:44,470
Right.

328
00:08:44,780 --> 00:08:45,530
Then I'll sing this one.

329
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:46,160
Who Do You Love?

330
00:08:46,160 --> 00:08:48,960
This is Chen Hewen's first time

331
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:49,880
singing this song at Signal House.

332
00:08:49,880 --> 00:08:50,880
There's a second time.

333
00:08:50,880 --> 00:08:51,640
And third.

334
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:54,160
Is this the only song you prepared?

335
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:56,160
I guess I just...

336
00:08:56,160 --> 00:08:57,440
I probably don't know that many songs.

337
00:09:02,520 --> 00:09:03,520
Like a "Prince Charming".

338
00:09:03,860 --> 00:09:04,930
He has the look sitting there.

339
00:09:04,950 --> 00:09:06,160
Is Cui Kaiyi really the type

340
00:09:06,160 --> 00:09:07,480
who's like a little ray of sunshine?

341
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:09,400
(Let me take a look. I have no idea)
Yeah, she's really lively.

342
00:09:09,400 --> 00:09:10,560
(This...)
She's really great.

343
00:09:13,020 --> 00:09:13,790
I'll carry that for you.

344
00:09:19,610 --> 00:09:20,930
Chen Hewen seems so relaxed.

345
00:09:20,930 --> 00:09:21,930
Will you sing with me?

346
00:09:21,930 --> 00:09:22,470
Sure.

347
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:23,760
Nice.

348
00:09:23,760 --> 00:09:25,400
I think in a small group,

349
00:09:25,400 --> 00:09:27,280
having someone who takes the initiative

350
00:09:27,280 --> 00:09:28,040
is a really good thing.

351
00:09:28,040 --> 00:09:28,900
It really helps loosen everyone up.

352
00:09:28,900 --> 00:09:30,240
Yeah.

353
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:30,840
Going up first to sing,

354
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:31,760
I was actually

355
00:09:31,760 --> 00:09:32,680
a little nervous.

356
00:09:32,680 --> 00:09:34,600
Zhao Xilun happened to come help me.

357
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:35,160
I asked if he wanted

358
00:09:35,160 --> 00:09:36,840
to sing with me if he knew the song.

359
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:38,160
I'm really grateful to Zhao Xilun.

360
00:09:40,060 --> 00:09:40,880
Then I'll give it a try.

361
00:09:42,380 --> 00:09:43,050
Sun Bohan.

362
00:09:43,050 --> 00:09:44,500
He jumped in first.

363
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:46,520
I went up there to embarrass myself.

364
00:09:46,520 --> 00:09:47,500
Just to see what it was like.

365
00:09:48,240 --> 00:09:49,600
What song did you sing again?

366
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:52,200
I was going to sing
Faye Wong's "Fleeting Times", but...

367
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:54,600
I couldn't keep up.

368
00:09:55,680 --> 00:09:56,400
It was so awkward.

369
00:09:56,400 --> 00:09:57,120
I just couldn't get into it.

370
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:58,360
So I switched to another song.

371
00:09:58,680 --> 00:10:00,280
Why did you choose that song?

372
00:10:00,600 --> 00:10:01,640
Honestly, there wasn't any reason.

373
00:10:01,640 --> 00:10:02,720
That song was just fine.

374
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:04,560
I simply liked it.

375
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:06,680
Yeah.

376
00:10:07,980 --> 00:10:09,230
I need someone to sing with me.

377
00:10:12,380 --> 00:10:13,180
Come over.

378
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:14,560
(Go on)
Come over.

379
00:10:14,560 --> 00:10:15,350
Go on.

380
00:10:16,760 --> 00:10:18,080
Very proactive.

381
00:10:19,720 --> 00:10:22,790
♪You ask how deeply I love you♪

382
00:10:22,840 --> 00:10:23,400
She's got such a...

383
00:10:23,400 --> 00:10:24,320
She sings so well.

384
00:10:24,320 --> 00:10:25,560
Really well.

385
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:26,360
Thank you.

386
00:10:26,360 --> 00:10:28,870
♪How much I love you♪

387
00:10:28,920 --> 00:10:30,600
Sun Bohan sounds great too.

388
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:32,040
I'm just here to make her shine.

389
00:10:32,040 --> 00:10:32,840
You seem really happy.

390
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:34,880
You have such a sunny, cheerful vibe.

391
00:10:34,880 --> 00:10:36,390
♪Take a look♪

392
00:10:36,400 --> 00:10:37,600
Sha Yue'er, you're so beautiful.

393
00:10:37,600 --> 00:10:38,160
Thank you.

394
00:10:38,160 --> 00:10:39,240
You're really beautiful.

395
00:10:39,240 --> 00:10:39,920
It's such a contrast.

396
00:10:39,920 --> 00:10:41,040
Because she actually sings

397
00:10:41,040 --> 00:10:43,200
Teresa Teng's songs.

398
00:10:44,510 --> 00:10:45,770
Then I'll sing

399
00:10:45,770 --> 00:10:47,000
Crescent Bay.

400
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:48,880
This song...

401
00:10:49,240 --> 00:10:50,600
She sang it so incredibly well.

402
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:51,520
After Liang Xiaoyu finished singing it,

403
00:10:51,520 --> 00:10:52,640
we were all stunned.

404
00:10:52,640 --> 00:10:54,360
It sounded just
like the original recording.

405
00:10:54,360 --> 00:10:54,720
Really?

406
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:55,680
She was amazing.

407
00:10:56,080 --> 00:10:56,960
It sounded so good.

408
00:10:57,190 --> 00:10:59,600
♪Whose heart is it?♪

409
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:00,710
That was amazing.

410
00:11:00,710 --> 00:11:02,720
♪Left there all alone♪

411
00:11:02,960 --> 00:11:04,560
She even added her own little touches.

412
00:11:05,570 --> 00:11:06,560
Sing it with me.

413
00:11:07,570 --> 00:11:08,020
Me?

414
00:11:08,780 --> 00:11:10,180
♪Whose heart is it?♪

415
00:11:10,180 --> 00:11:10,980
(Trying to join in)

416
00:11:11,260 --> 00:11:12,380
Hahaha!

417
00:11:12,380 --> 00:11:13,430
♪Left there all alone♪

418
00:11:13,430 --> 00:11:15,290
♪Is he doing okay?♪

419
00:11:15,290 --> 00:11:18,370
(Trying to join in x2)
♪How I wish I could love him♪

420
00:11:18,860 --> 00:11:20,320
Hahaha!

421
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:21,440
How's he supposed to join in?

422
00:11:23,080 --> 00:11:24,080
He can't sing.

423
00:11:25,040 --> 00:11:26,320
He stood up to "serve his time".

424
00:11:27,230 --> 00:11:28,850
♪Run♪

425
00:11:29,960 --> 00:11:32,310
♪And run♪

426
00:11:33,160 --> 00:11:34,840
Third attempt to join in, and he failed.

427
00:11:35,560 --> 00:11:37,360
Why is Cui Yihang so cute?

428
00:11:40,380 --> 00:11:41,200
Amazing.

429
00:11:41,480 --> 00:11:42,720
Did everyone sing?

430
00:11:42,720 --> 00:11:43,920
I didn't.

431
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:46,960
I was just really nervous at the time.

432
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:50,080
With so many people,
I didn't know what to say.

433
00:11:50,080 --> 00:11:50,920
I felt so awkward.

434
00:11:50,920 --> 00:11:51,800
It's okay.

435
00:11:52,280 --> 00:11:53,960
You're still very beautiful.

436
00:11:56,750 --> 00:11:57,520
What does that mean?

437
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:00,510
It's okay.

438
00:12:01,460 --> 00:12:02,460
(Text message: New guest chose
to share a car with you)

439
00:12:02,460 --> 00:12:03,180
(On the way back
to Signal House together)

440
00:12:03,180 --> 00:12:03,980
(You can get to know each other better.
Have a safe trip back)

441
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:05,880
Was it a shock when you received that?

442
00:12:09,380 --> 00:12:11,500
A little, yeah.

443
00:12:11,520 --> 00:12:12,680
Honestly, it wasn't that shocking.

444
00:12:12,680 --> 00:12:14,920
You two had talked
quite a bit back then.

445
00:12:15,360 --> 00:12:16,040
Did we?

446
00:12:16,040 --> 00:12:17,960
Yeah. Didn't you just see it?

447
00:12:20,040 --> 00:12:21,360
How did you feel at the time?

448
00:12:23,280 --> 00:12:25,080
I didn't know about that text.

449
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:27,880
How were they supposed
to get in the car?

450
00:12:27,880 --> 00:12:29,920
Wouldn't you all know
as soon as they got in?

451
00:12:29,920 --> 00:12:30,720
Look.

452
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:32,120
(Invitation)
The game is starting.

453
00:12:33,330 --> 00:12:33,820
Let's go.

454
00:12:34,160 --> 00:12:35,360
(Go)
I don't think I can watch this part.

455
00:12:35,360 --> 00:12:35,920
Honestly.

456
00:12:36,510 --> 00:12:37,410
Yu Yang,

457
00:12:37,530 --> 00:12:38,460
how about the four of us ride together?

458
00:12:38,460 --> 00:12:39,320
Sure. Let's go.

459
00:12:40,010 --> 00:12:40,840
What do you say?

460
00:12:44,920 --> 00:12:45,600
At that point, Sha Yue'er, you...

461
00:12:45,600 --> 00:12:47,560
I was actually waiting

462
00:12:47,560 --> 00:12:49,440
for Chen Hewen to invite me.

463
00:12:52,330 --> 00:12:53,280
We're this one, right?

464
00:12:53,990 --> 00:12:55,260
We're this one.

465
00:12:56,570 --> 00:12:59,240
(Then we're going back together)
If I were in Sha Yue'er's shoes,

466
00:12:59,240 --> 00:13:00,320
I'd probably feel

467
00:13:01,240 --> 00:13:02,040
just as confused.

468
00:13:05,470 --> 00:13:06,410
You sit in the passenger seat.

469
00:13:06,410 --> 00:13:07,120
I'll drive.

470
00:13:07,370 --> 00:13:07,600
Okay.

471
00:13:07,620 --> 00:13:08,640
Were you mad at the time?

472
00:13:08,840 --> 00:13:10,440
I was.

473
00:13:11,960 --> 00:13:12,760
That's direct.

474
00:13:13,120 --> 00:13:15,040
Sha Yue'er is nothing if not direct.

475
00:13:15,840 --> 00:13:17,240
I don't think I was mad.

476
00:13:17,240 --> 00:13:18,560
I was just kind of speechless.

477
00:13:20,240 --> 00:13:21,040
Honestly,

478
00:13:21,040 --> 00:13:22,480
there's one thing
I still don't understand.

479
00:13:22,480 --> 00:13:23,880
He got that text.

480
00:13:23,880 --> 00:13:25,040
He could've just told me.

481
00:13:25,040 --> 00:13:26,160
Yeah, I actually wanted to ask you too.

482
00:13:26,160 --> 00:13:27,600
Why didn't you say anything?

483
00:13:29,360 --> 00:13:30,680
You know, in that situation,

484
00:13:30,680 --> 00:13:32,160
I mean,

485
00:13:32,160 --> 00:13:34,240
Liang Xiaoyu sent the invitation.

486
00:13:34,240 --> 00:13:35,400
And she was standing
really close to Sha Yue'er.

487
00:13:35,400 --> 00:13:36,360
If I went over

488
00:13:36,360 --> 00:13:37,200
and explained it to Sha Yue'er,

489
00:13:37,200 --> 00:13:38,000
I'd feel like

490
00:13:38,440 --> 00:13:39,240
I was making it...

491
00:13:39,240 --> 00:13:40,160
So you didn't say anything back then

492
00:13:40,160 --> 00:13:42,200
because you were actually trying

493
00:13:42,200 --> 00:13:43,480
to consider the other girl's feelings,

494
00:13:43,480 --> 00:13:44,320
right?

495
00:13:44,320 --> 00:13:46,400
So if Liang Xiaoyu had texted you,

496
00:13:46,400 --> 00:13:48,120
asking you to ride with her,

497
00:13:48,120 --> 00:13:50,480
could you still invite someone else

498
00:13:50,480 --> 00:13:51,060
to join you?

499
00:13:51,060 --> 00:13:51,580
The text said

500
00:13:51,580 --> 00:13:52,720
it was just the two of us in one car.

501
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:53,440
Oh, the two of you.

502
00:13:53,440 --> 00:13:53,760
Yeah.

503
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:54,680
Because at the time,

504
00:13:55,320 --> 00:13:57,320
I never thought Liang Xiaoyu
would choose me.

505
00:13:57,320 --> 00:13:58,520
I thought

506
00:13:58,520 --> 00:13:59,520
from the way she interacted with Cui Yihang,

507
00:13:59,520 --> 00:14:00,800
she'd probably choose him.

508
00:14:00,800 --> 00:14:01,960
Then,

509
00:14:01,960 --> 00:14:04,040
I suddenly got a message
while I was eating.

510
00:14:04,040 --> 00:14:04,800
It said

511
00:14:04,800 --> 00:14:05,680
Liang Xiaoyu

512
00:14:05,680 --> 00:14:07,760
had invited you

513
00:14:07,760 --> 00:14:09,560
to, basically,

514
00:14:09,560 --> 00:14:10,960
drive back together.

515
00:14:10,960 --> 00:14:11,600
She chose me.

516
00:14:11,600 --> 00:14:12,560
So I was confused too.

517
00:14:12,560 --> 00:14:13,600
But then I thought,

518
00:14:13,600 --> 00:14:15,280
since I got the text,
I should follow the rules.

519
00:14:15,280 --> 00:14:17,040
Maybe she wanted to get
to know everyone equally.

520
00:14:17,040 --> 00:14:18,000
But maybe

521
00:14:18,200 --> 00:14:19,160
she wanted to prioritize someone,

522
00:14:19,160 --> 00:14:20,240
and the two of us could

523
00:14:20,240 --> 00:14:21,160
get to know each other on the way home.

524
00:14:21,160 --> 00:14:23,520
When you went back that day,
you didn't talk to me.

525
00:14:23,520 --> 00:14:25,000
I felt really awkward that day.

526
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:26,400
I honestly didn't know how to face you.

527
00:14:26,400 --> 00:14:26,960
I just felt...

528
00:14:27,480 --> 00:14:28,280
Kind of dazed.

529
00:14:28,280 --> 00:14:28,800
Yeah, kind of dazed.

530
00:14:28,800 --> 00:14:30,040
I thought this might

531
00:14:30,040 --> 00:14:32,200
cause some misunderstandings

532
00:14:32,200 --> 00:14:32,960
or confusion.

533
00:14:32,960 --> 00:14:35,000
Si, did you see what happened?

534
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:35,760
I saw it.

535
00:14:35,760 --> 00:14:37,160
I just didn't know their perspective.

536
00:14:37,160 --> 00:14:38,240
Their perspectives were different.

537
00:14:38,240 --> 00:14:39,360
Yeah, different perspectives.

538
00:14:39,880 --> 00:14:40,160
Okay.

539
00:14:40,160 --> 00:14:41,040
Let's keep watching.

540
00:14:41,040 --> 00:14:42,340
Yeah, I'll put my stuff in the back.

541
00:14:43,620 --> 00:14:45,230
Given the situation,

542
00:14:45,230 --> 00:14:46,450
it might've been better

543
00:14:46,450 --> 00:14:48,060
if he had explained.

544
00:14:48,060 --> 00:14:49,110
(I have something to say)
From a guy's perspective,

545
00:14:49,110 --> 00:14:50,030
I don't think it was a big deal.

546
00:14:50,030 --> 00:14:50,600
It's fine.

547
00:14:50,610 --> 00:14:51,640
Just get in the car

548
00:14:51,640 --> 00:14:52,610
and explain it afterward.

549
00:14:52,610 --> 00:14:53,490
Or maybe he genuinely felt

550
00:14:53,490 --> 00:14:54,750
he had nothing to hide.

551
00:14:54,750 --> 00:14:55,700
I didn't do anything wrong,

552
00:14:55,700 --> 00:14:57,710
so I didn't think
there was any need to explain.

553
00:14:58,280 --> 00:14:59,160
I salute you.

554
00:15:01,580 --> 00:15:02,280
Meng,

555
00:15:02,280 --> 00:15:03,600
you sounded amazing today.

556
00:15:03,850 --> 00:15:04,880
You sounded great too.

557
00:15:05,190 --> 00:15:06,620
Honestly, I was so embarrassed.

558
00:15:06,620 --> 00:15:07,510
But seriously,

559
00:15:07,510 --> 00:15:08,560
you really sounded like Teresa Teng.

560
00:15:08,560 --> 00:15:09,380
You really sounded

561
00:15:09,380 --> 00:15:10,360
just like the original singer.

562
00:15:10,360 --> 00:15:12,080
You have such great control
over your voice.

563
00:15:12,080 --> 00:15:13,090
Your soft mix was really good.

564
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:13,760
Be honest.

565
00:15:13,760 --> 00:15:15,160
Were you fishing for compliments?

566
00:15:15,160 --> 00:15:15,960
No.

567
00:15:16,280 --> 00:15:17,400
Because at the time, I felt like

568
00:15:17,400 --> 00:15:18,560
my emotions might've been showing.

569
00:15:19,960 --> 00:15:21,160
You were still caught up

570
00:15:21,160 --> 00:15:22,440
in what happened earlier, right?

571
00:15:23,080 --> 00:15:24,080
Yeah.

572
00:15:25,280 --> 00:15:26,680
So I found an excuse

573
00:15:26,680 --> 00:15:28,840
to make it seem like there was a reason

574
00:15:28,840 --> 00:15:30,040
without letting everyone know

575
00:15:30,040 --> 00:15:31,360
what the real reason was.

576
00:15:33,480 --> 00:15:34,920
Sun Bohan, could you tell

577
00:15:34,920 --> 00:15:35,920
