578
00:15:35,920 --> 00:15:37,520
I could tell you weren't
in a great mood.

579
00:15:37,520 --> 00:15:38,000
Yeah.

580
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:40,800
Emotions tend to build up.

581
00:15:40,800 --> 00:15:41,720
And over time,

582
00:15:41,720 --> 00:15:43,440
you start connecting

583
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:45,560
all the negative things together.

584
00:15:47,520 --> 00:15:48,200
From my perspective,

585
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:49,920
I might've been
in a different headspace than you.

586
00:15:51,600 --> 00:15:53,800
At the time,
I didn't think too much about it.

587
00:15:53,800 --> 00:15:54,440
I just felt...

588
00:15:54,440 --> 00:15:56,560
There wasn't really a right or wrong.

589
00:15:56,560 --> 00:15:57,200
Both sides had their reasons.

590
00:15:58,840 --> 00:15:59,640
Yeah, if that's how you put it,

591
00:15:59,640 --> 00:16:00,920
there's definitely no problem.

592
00:16:02,800 --> 00:16:04,920
Zhao Xilun and I just wanted you to...

593
00:16:04,920 --> 00:16:05,840
Feel happier and relax a little.

594
00:16:05,840 --> 00:16:06,360
Relax a little.

595
00:16:06,360 --> 00:16:07,040
Yeah.

596
00:16:07,760 --> 00:16:10,120
I just felt like you guys
were really great.

597
00:16:10,120 --> 00:16:10,800
You're absolutely right.

598
00:16:10,800 --> 00:16:11,560
We really are great.

599
00:16:11,580 --> 00:16:12,900
(Just teasing)

600
00:16:16,340 --> 00:16:17,300
(Repeating)

601
00:16:17,800 --> 00:16:19,200
Zhao Xilun and...

602
00:16:19,520 --> 00:16:20,090
And...

603
00:16:20,800 --> 00:16:21,120
And?

604
00:16:21,360 --> 00:16:22,000
And you.

605
00:16:22,560 --> 00:16:23,180
You.

606
00:16:23,560 --> 00:16:24,130
I'm hurt.

607
00:16:24,130 --> 00:16:24,780
You three.

608
00:16:24,780 --> 00:16:25,460
What's my name?

609
00:16:25,460 --> 00:16:26,400
What is my name?

610
00:16:27,400 --> 00:16:28,720
What do you mean?

611
00:16:30,680 --> 00:16:31,560
Wait.

612
00:16:31,560 --> 00:16:33,160
Did you forget his name?

613
00:16:33,640 --> 00:16:34,320
You forgot his name?

614
00:16:34,320 --> 00:16:35,120
I forgot.

615
00:16:35,320 --> 00:16:36,760
How many days has it been?

616
00:16:36,760 --> 00:16:37,440
It's already been...

617
00:16:39,320 --> 00:16:40,520
That's just how her memory is.

618
00:16:41,480 --> 00:16:42,200
I was wrong, Sun Bohan.

619
00:16:42,200 --> 00:16:43,040
Seven-second memory.

620
00:16:43,040 --> 00:16:44,720
I'm sorry. Please forgive me.

621
00:16:48,940 --> 00:16:49,790
What do you feel

622
00:16:49,790 --> 00:16:50,650
when you first

623
00:16:51,050 --> 00:16:52,630
get that message?

624
00:16:52,630 --> 00:16:54,080
I kept wondering why it was me.

625
00:16:55,400 --> 00:16:56,320
I was wondering the same thing.

626
00:16:56,320 --> 00:16:57,280
When I said I was curious,

627
00:16:57,280 --> 00:16:57,880
I really meant it.

628
00:16:57,880 --> 00:16:58,830
You got things off to a great start.

629
00:16:59,120 --> 00:17:00,820
You were also the one

630
00:17:00,830 --> 00:17:01,710
who took charge

631
00:17:02,280 --> 00:17:03,840
of getting everyone together
and breaking the ice.

632
00:17:03,840 --> 00:17:04,510
So that really stuck with me.

633
00:17:04,510 --> 00:17:05,850
You noticed that?

634
00:17:06,600 --> 00:17:07,760
You're really observant.

635
00:17:09,040 --> 00:17:10,600
I noticed it too.

636
00:17:10,600 --> 00:17:13,120
You really were the one

637
00:17:13,120 --> 00:17:14,880
who got everyone to loosen up.

638
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:16,920
Chen Hewen is the leader.

639
00:17:16,920 --> 00:17:18,880
He's the one who organizes everything.

640
00:17:21,020 --> 00:17:22,060
So, who was in Blue Space (Empathetic Love)?

641
00:17:22,060 --> 00:17:23,440
(Keep asking)
Blue Space (Empathetic Love).

642
00:17:23,440 --> 00:17:23,920
There was

643
00:17:23,920 --> 00:17:25,210
