644
00:17:25,210 --> 00:17:26,170
Yeah, Xihang.

645
00:17:26,630 --> 00:17:27,460
(Xihang)
And then...

646
00:17:27,460 --> 00:17:28,160
Blue Space (Empathetic Love).

647
00:17:28,200 --> 00:17:29,360
(Is it Xihang?)
Not this again.

648
00:17:31,160 --> 00:17:32,600
(Zhao Xilun)
You were just making fun of me.

649
00:17:32,600 --> 00:17:33,560
What's going on?

650
00:17:34,400 --> 00:17:35,720
Does everyone have a bad memory?

651
00:17:35,720 --> 00:17:36,560
What's wrong with this kid?

652
00:17:37,020 --> 00:17:38,240
No wonder we're both

653
00:17:38,240 --> 00:17:39,200
in Red Space (Passionate Love).

654
00:17:41,950 --> 00:17:42,700
At the dinner that night,

655
00:17:43,410 --> 00:17:44,870
