658
00:17:49,280 --> 00:17:50,440
Why a dragonfly?

659
00:17:51,410 --> 00:17:52,800
Not a dragonfly. A fairy.

660
00:17:52,800 --> 00:17:54,960
I know. I didn't say dragonfly.

661
00:17:59,680 --> 00:18:01,840
I really felt like
he was saying it on purpose.

662
00:18:01,840 --> 00:18:03,480
It just didn't feel good.

663
00:18:03,480 --> 00:18:04,680
I misunderstood him a little back then.

664
00:18:05,040 --> 00:18:05,560
No, stop.

665
00:18:05,560 --> 00:18:07,880
Why is everyone in our house so funny?

666
00:18:12,090 --> 00:18:13,150
Thanks.

667
00:18:14,330 --> 00:18:15,440
Just give me the luggage.

668
00:18:17,760 --> 00:18:18,770
Something might be off.

669
00:18:18,980 --> 00:18:20,050
It's okay.

670
00:18:21,470 --> 00:18:22,940
Shouldn't we go upstairs first
and put our stuff down?

671
00:18:22,940 --> 00:18:23,770
Yeah, we should.

672
00:18:25,280 --> 00:18:27,520
It really showed on her face.

673
00:18:27,520 --> 00:18:29,560
I thought I was already holding it in.

674
00:18:30,800 --> 00:18:32,120
That obvious?

675
00:18:34,040 --> 00:18:35,280
I told you right then,

676
00:18:35,280 --> 00:18:36,880
I saw you downstairs.

677
00:18:37,400 --> 00:18:38,640
But you didn't talk to me.

678
00:18:38,640 --> 00:18:39,640
I really didn't mean to.

679
00:18:39,640 --> 00:18:40,600
You acted like you couldn't even see me.

680
00:18:40,600 --> 00:18:41,520
I really didn't mean to.

681
00:18:41,520 --> 00:18:42,560
I had no idea
what was going through my head.

682
00:18:42,560 --> 00:18:44,200
You'd asked so many times

683
00:18:44,200 --> 00:18:45,160
