684
00:18:45,160 --> 00:18:47,200
Then you saw me
and acted like I wasn't there.

685
00:18:48,120 --> 00:18:49,840
I'm seriously oblivious.

686
00:18:49,840 --> 00:18:50,880
I really am.

687
00:18:51,600 --> 00:18:52,760
I think we even made eye contact

688
00:18:52,760 --> 00:18:55,480
at this corner of the stairs.

689
00:18:56,480 --> 00:18:57,280
Look.

690
00:18:57,300 --> 00:18:59,340
