691
00:19:00,160 --> 00:19:00,820
There was.

692
00:19:01,580 --> 00:19:02,030
Where?

693
00:19:02,030 --> 00:19:02,340
Did we?

694
00:19:02,340 --> 00:19:02,620
Look at me.

695
00:19:02,620 --> 00:19:02,840
I...

696
00:19:02,840 --> 00:19:03,980
I didn't even see you.

697
00:19:04,120 --> 00:19:05,240
That was a total misunderstanding.

698
00:19:06,080 --> 00:19:07,360
You definitely saw me.

699
00:19:07,360 --> 00:19:08,040
Look.

700
00:19:08,040 --> 00:19:08,960
Go back and watch it again.

701
00:19:08,960 --> 00:19:10,320
How could you not see me?

702
00:19:10,320 --> 00:19:12,400
I really don't remember seeing you then.

703
00:19:15,200 --> 00:19:15,480
Look.

704
00:19:15,480 --> 00:19:15,840
Look at me.

705
00:19:15,840 --> 00:19:17,340
(Staring)
I...

706
00:19:17,360 --> 00:19:18,720
That look on your face.

707
00:19:20,620 --> 00:19:21,440
I'll go back to the room first.

708
00:19:21,480 --> 00:19:22,430
(Let's put this away)
You even went back to your room.

709
00:19:22,430 --> 00:19:22,900
Okay.

710
00:19:23,960 --> 00:19:25,320
Look at your face. It's so obvious.

711
00:19:25,760 --> 00:19:26,840
You were so obvious back then.

712
00:19:26,840 --> 00:19:29,000
I didn't realize I was that obvious.

713
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:30,360
You know what?

714
00:19:32,160 --> 00:19:33,560
We were having
such a good time in the car.

715
00:19:33,560 --> 00:19:34,520
Then, as soon as we got
into Signal House,

716
00:19:34,520 --> 00:19:35,880
I didn't know what was going on.

717
00:19:36,280 --> 00:19:38,520
But your face suddenly changed.

718
00:19:38,840 --> 00:19:40,000
Your face suddenly changed.

719
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:41,200
I thought you were acting kind of weird.

720
00:19:41,200 --> 00:19:43,800
It suddenly felt like you were upset.

721
00:19:43,960 --> 00:19:44,440
I'm sorry.

722
00:19:44,440 --> 00:19:46,040
I was really too oblivious back then.

723
00:19:46,040 --> 00:19:47,120
I really didn't mean to.

724
00:19:48,160 --> 00:19:49,800
I think maybe once we got inside,

725
00:19:49,800 --> 00:19:51,400
everyone was dealing
with their own stuff,

726
00:19:51,400 --> 00:19:52,960
and everything just happened at once.

727
00:19:52,960 --> 00:19:53,960
Sometimes, you just don't get

728
00:19:53,960 --> 00:19:55,000
a chance to stop

729
00:19:55,000 --> 00:19:56,200
and talk.

730
00:19:56,200 --> 00:19:57,520
Exactly.

731
00:19:57,520 --> 00:19:59,480
Looking at it
from a third-person perspective,

732
00:19:59,480 --> 00:20:00,720
from the outside,

733
00:20:00,720 --> 00:20:02,720
you know that if I don't say it today,

734
00:20:02,720 --> 00:20:03,920
things might be different tomorrow.

735
00:20:03,920 --> 00:20:05,640
But from your own perspective
at the time,

736
00:20:05,640 --> 00:20:06,800
