737
00:20:07,520 --> 00:20:08,460
You don't realize
that if you don't say it,

738
00:20:08,460 --> 00:20:09,140
the other person

739
00:20:09,140 --> 00:20:10,310
(Progress)
may already see it that way.

740
00:20:10,320 --> 00:20:11,880
Right.

741
00:20:12,200 --> 00:20:13,640
I totally get it.

742
00:20:14,640 --> 00:20:15,840
Sha Yue'er, are you over it now?

743
00:20:16,280 --> 00:20:17,360
I'm not mad.

744
00:20:17,360 --> 00:20:17,920
It's already...

745
00:20:17,920 --> 00:20:19,280
Yeah, it's all in the past now.

746
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:21,000
You were definitely mad back then.

747
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:22,120
I was.

748
00:20:23,520 --> 00:20:25,280
I understand. I get it.

749
00:20:25,960 --> 00:20:26,840
You know what I mean.

750
00:20:26,980 --> 00:20:27,860
Hahaha.

751
00:20:28,000 --> 00:20:29,040
Si, do you get it?

752
00:20:29,040 --> 00:20:29,520
I get it now.

753
00:20:32,890 --> 00:20:34,130
We can sit here for a bit,

754
00:20:34,130 --> 00:20:34,790
