755
00:20:35,660 --> 00:20:36,360
Yeah, okay.

756
00:20:38,440 --> 00:20:39,240
Okay.

757
00:20:39,240 --> 00:20:40,150
What do you mean, "okay"?

758
00:20:40,640 --> 00:20:41,520
He's probably nervous too.

759
00:20:42,200 --> 00:20:43,480
(Cao Yiheng)
Yesterday they asked me

760
00:20:43,480 --> 00:20:44,240
