764
00:20:52,880 --> 00:20:55,680
I think it's pretty fun
watching everyone else talk.

765
00:20:55,780 --> 00:20:56,120
Yeah.

766
00:20:56,120 --> 00:20:57,480
Right? It's more fun
than watching ourselves.

767
00:20:57,500 --> 00:20:58,240
Exactly.

768
00:20:58,240 --> 00:20:59,240
Watching ourselves is embarrassing.

769
00:20:59,300 --> 00:21:00,260
Yeah, that's right.

770
00:21:00,720 --> 00:21:02,520
When you watch others,
do you ever think,

771
00:21:02,520 --> 00:21:03,920
