772
00:21:04,640 --> 00:21:05,840
Yeah. Right now, I'm thinking that.

773
00:21:05,840 --> 00:21:07,800
I've never heard
Cao Yiheng talk this much.

774
00:21:10,480 --> 00:21:12,640
Cao Yiheng is always quiet around us.

775
00:21:12,920 --> 00:21:14,960
He's the type
who opens up more as time goes on.

776
00:21:15,440 --> 00:21:16,240
Yeah.

777
00:21:16,600 --> 00:21:19,760
Maybe he saved everything for Cui Kaiyi.

778
00:21:22,280 --> 00:21:23,280
So, these past two days,

779
00:21:23,840 --> 00:21:24,910
