to know any of the other girls?

780
00:21:25,440 --> 00:21:25,890
No.

781
00:21:31,120 --> 00:21:32,470
I can't really put my feelings

782
00:21:32,470 --> 00:21:33,390
into

783
00:21:34,100 --> 00:21:34,960
