784
00:21:38,130 --> 00:21:38,900
That makes sense.

785
00:21:42,780 --> 00:21:43,580
What about you?

786
00:21:44,000 --> 00:21:45,880
How is he so good at this?

787
00:21:45,880 --> 00:21:46,660
I never knew

788
00:21:46,660 --> 00:21:47,880
