791
00:21:56,200 --> 00:21:57,560
How is that any different
from a confession?

792
00:22:01,070 --> 00:22:01,760
Hi.

793
00:22:02,310 --> 00:22:03,450
How are you today?

794
00:22:03,450 --> 00:22:04,410
Are you happy today?

795
00:22:04,410 --> 00:22:06,580
Super happy.

796
00:22:07,630 --> 00:22:09,040
I'm not doing so great today.

797
00:22:12,320 --> 00:22:14,000
You still haven't gotten over

798
00:22:14,300 --> 00:22:15,520
(I was actually waiting for)
that "car incident".

799
00:22:15,520 --> 00:22:16,040
Yeah.

800
00:22:16,040 --> 00:22:16,830
Chen Hewen.

801
00:22:17,400 --> 00:22:17,790
But...

802
00:22:17,790 --> 00:22:20,510
Chen Hewen left with the new girl, right?

803
00:22:20,510 --> 00:22:21,480
What kind of guy is he?

804
00:22:21,480 --> 00:22:22,960
What was that supposed to mean?

805
00:22:24,200 --> 00:22:25,440
What kind of guy?

806
00:22:25,800 --> 00:22:28,280
I love you, Cui Kaiyi.

807
00:22:31,050 --> 00:22:32,060
Anyway, compared to him,

808
00:22:32,060 --> 00:22:33,390
Cao Yiheng definitely wouldn't do that.

809
00:22:38,320 --> 00:22:39,320
When she said that,

810
00:22:39,320 --> 00:22:40,840
