816
00:22:51,490 --> 00:22:52,190
Who is it?

817
00:22:54,350 --> 00:22:54,930
No way.

818
00:22:55,080 --> 00:22:56,480
The suspense is killing me.

819
00:22:57,260 --> 00:22:57,890
Wait.

820
00:22:57,890 --> 00:22:58,650
I got a text.

821
00:22:59,180 --> 00:23:00,240
(Congratulations!
You are the Courageous for this date.)

822
00:23:00,240 --> 00:23:01,800
(Get your Courageous flower)
Sun Qimeng is the Courageous.

823
00:23:02,110 --> 00:23:03,310
