836
00:23:36,000 --> 00:23:37,650
and give it to the girl
you want to ask out.

837
00:23:38,600 --> 00:23:39,090
Hello.

838
00:23:39,760 --> 00:23:40,430
Hi.

839
00:23:41,050 --> 00:23:42,140
This is for you.

840
00:23:42,140 --> 00:23:43,140
For me?

841
00:23:43,140 --> 00:23:43,550
Yeah.

842
00:23:43,550 --> 00:23:44,450
I got it for you.

843
00:23:45,910 --> 00:23:46,680
Yeah, I got it for you.

844
00:23:47,000 --> 00:23:48,760
I was so confused at the time.

845
00:23:48,760 --> 00:23:50,040
Because from my perspective,

846
00:23:50,040 --> 00:23:52,040
I met Zhao Xilun first on the first day.

847
00:23:52,040 --> 00:23:53,160
He went
to the Blue Space (Empathetic Love),

848
00:23:53,160 --> 00:23:54,400
